        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu omedere woth aka oneno wutmere ario man, Yakobo kodi Yohana, yac pa Zebedayo. Onwaŋo jonitie i ye pajo gi ba gin Zebedayo joyiko bwo pajo, to lwoŋo jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
