        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu owotho i Galili parom, munyo fonjo Wac Manyen Maber kwoŋ Ker pa Were i kalamo pa Joyuda, gi botho two kodi ramirok ma nger je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
